could be shipped): `. ./base.sh`, `. ./variant.sh`, `hork__is_converged`,
`hork__is_converged`, `hork__is_converged 2>/dev/null`, `hork__is_converged` --
run `dorc why` for the per-site detail (the apply runs each anyway, to stay
safe)
